---
// Where the five harness elements are developed in the book (Chapters 2–5), and the chapters that sit outside them.
---

<svg
	class="dg"
	viewBox="0 0 720 380"
	role="img"
	aria-labelledby="d-hem-title d-hem-desc"
	style="min-width: 630px"
>
	<title id="d-hem-title">How the five harness elements map to the book</title>
	<desc id="d-hem-desc">
		Four harness focus areas on the left each point to one chapter on the right: context management to Chapter 2,
		context engineering; context across sessions to Chapter 3, memory and knowledge; tool interfaces and constraints to
		Chapter 4, tools; verification and correction to Chapter 5, coding and general agents. A bottom row, outside the
		five elements, holds Chapter 6, interaction, which widens the observation and action spaces; Chapters 7 to 9,
		evaluate and improve; and Chapter 10, multi-agent.
	</desc>
	<defs>
		<marker id="d-hem-arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
			<path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" class="dg-arrowhead"></path>
		</marker>
	</defs>

	<text x="360" y="32" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-title">How the five harness elements map to the book</text>

	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="12" y="52" width="290" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="157" y="80" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Context management</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="302" y1="74" x2="406" y2="74" marker-end="url(#d-hem-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="408" y="52" width="300" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="558" y="80" text-anchor="middle">Ch 2 Context engineering</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-context">
		<rect x="12" y="106" width="290" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="157" y="134" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Context across sessions</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="302" y1="128" x2="406" y2="128" marker-end="url(#d-hem-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="408" y="106" width="300" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="558" y="134" text-anchor="middle">Ch 3 Memory &amp; knowledge</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-tools">
		<rect x="12" y="160" width="290" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="157" y="188" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Tool interfaces &amp; constraints</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="302" y1="182" x2="406" y2="182" marker-end="url(#d-hem-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="408" y="160" width="300" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="558" y="188" text-anchor="middle">Ch 4 Tools</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-guard">
		<rect x="12" y="214" width="290" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="157" y="242" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-accent" font-weight="700">Verification &amp; correction</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-edge">
		<line x1="302" y1="236" x2="406" y2="236" marker-end="url(#d-hem-arrow)"></line>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="408" y="214" width="300" height="44" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="558" y="242" text-anchor="middle">Ch 5 Coding &amp; general agents</text>
	</g>

	<text x="12" y="292" class="dg-sub">outside the five elements</text>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="12" y="306" width="224" height="62" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="124" y="332" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">Ch 6 Interaction</text>
		<text x="124" y="354" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">widens obs/action spaces</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="248" y="306" width="224" height="62" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="360" y="332" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">Ch 7–9</text>
		<text x="360" y="354" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Evaluate &amp; improve</text>
	</g>
	<g class="dg-node dg-neutral">
		<rect x="484" y="306" width="224" height="62" rx="10"></rect>
		<text x="596" y="332" text-anchor="middle" font-weight="700">Ch 10</text>
		<text x="596" y="354" text-anchor="middle" class="dg-sub">Multi-agent</text>
	</g>
</svg>
